WEBVTT

1
00:55:42.914 --> 00:55:50.434
Are there people here for the first time in Open Church today?

2
00:55:50.434 --> 00:55:54.154
Yes? Look over there, can I get a round of applause for all our guests?

3
00:55:54.154 --> 00:56:00.754
Welcome, welcome, welcome. May I ask where you are from?

4
00:56:00.754 --> 00:56:06.554
From Weert? Just Limburg, just not Limburg?

5
00:56:06.554 --> 00:56:10.914
You belong here too, really. Very nice, very nice.

6
00:56:11.194 --> 00:56:14.634
Weert, wonderful. Praise God.

7
00:56:16.754 --> 00:56:20.274
Who has to drive longer than 50 minutes to get to church?

8
00:56:20.274 --> 00:56:26.674
Longer than 50... Philippe, right? Who is standing next to you, Philippe, by the way?

9
00:56:26.674 --> 00:56:29.514
That person who is standing next to you, to your right.

10
00:56:29.514 --> 00:56:34.314
Ah, nice. But they come here more often, right?

11
00:56:34.314 --> 00:56:36.354
Yes, yes, yes. Nice, nice, nice.

12
00:56:36.354 --> 00:56:39.434
You all really drive an hour to get to church.

13
00:56:39.634 --> 00:56:44.674
I love it, I love it. Praise God, welcome to the church of Jesus Christ.

14
00:56:44.674 --> 00:56:49.474
Praise God. Debbie can invite you for the offering.

15
00:56:49.474 --> 00:56:57.874
I have a very beautiful text. For me, it can be behind.

16
00:56:57.874 --> 00:57:06.994
I don't need to hear myself. Trust with all your heart in the Lord

17
00:57:07.154 --> 00:57:12.754
and do not rely on your own wisdom. Or should I say stubbornness?

18
00:57:16.754 --> 00:57:21.754
Next. Discuss all your plans with Him, then He will guide your life.

19
00:57:23.754 --> 00:57:27.954
And if you have been walking with Him for a while, you might say, oh, but I already know that text.

20
00:57:27.954 --> 00:57:34.394
Yes, very good. The question is... It can go back to the first verse.

21
00:57:34.794 --> 00:57:41.794
The question is, do you know that text by heart? Or do you know that text from your heart?

22
00:57:44.794 --> 00:57:49.794
Very good. You know, if you trust God with all your heart,

23
00:57:51.794 --> 00:57:55.794
then you can leave all the details of your life to Him.

24
00:57:56.794 --> 00:58:02.794
One of my favorite verses is, love the Lord with all your heart.

25
00:58:04.794 --> 00:58:08.794
And here it says, trust the Lord with all your heart.

26
00:58:09.794 --> 00:58:17.794
These two go hand in hand. It cannot be that you love Him but do not trust Him.

27
00:58:18.794 --> 00:58:23.794
That doesn't work. Or that you trust Him but do not love Him.

28
00:58:24.794 --> 00:58:32.794
And you know, if you say, I trust Him 100%, then you can give your past to Him.

29
00:58:33.194 --> 00:58:38.194
What happened in your past? What emotions are there? You can give those to Him.

30
00:58:39.194 --> 00:58:42.194
He is loving. You can trust Him.

31
00:58:43.194 --> 00:58:49.194
But you can also give your present and your future. Also your financial future.

32
00:58:50.194 --> 00:58:58.194
Yes, but that is all uncertain. But you can trust Him. He is loving. He is trustworthy.

33
00:58:58.594 --> 00:59:06.594
And one of the songs we sometimes sing is, even when you and I do not see, He is working for you.

34
00:59:07.594 --> 00:59:15.594
In the background, He is always ready for you. Even when we are not paying attention, because that is usually the case,

35
00:59:15.594 --> 00:59:20.594
when we do not see it, because we are not paying attention, then He is working for you.

36
00:59:21.594 --> 00:59:26.594
And whether that is in your finances or in other areas of your life, it does not matter.

37
00:59:26.994 --> 00:59:34.994
He helps you with a new job, with your finances, with the challenges therein.

38
00:59:35.994 --> 00:59:42.994
But do we also trust Him? Because in the same chapter, the following is also stated.

39
00:59:43.994 --> 00:59:44.994
That is verse 9.

40
00:59:45.994 --> 00:59:48.994
Give to the Lord from what you possess.

41
00:59:49.994 --> 00:59:53.994
Yes, that actually makes sense. You cannot give something that belongs to your neighbors.

42
00:59:54.394 --> 00:59:56.394
Give the Lord of your possessions.

43
00:59:57.394 --> 01:00:00.394
Give Him the first part of your harvest.

44
01:00:01.394 --> 01:00:09.394
Now, I think there aren't many farmers here, so harvest today for us is our salary.

45
01:00:10.394 --> 01:00:12.394
That is the yield of our work.

46
01:00:13.394 --> 01:00:15.394
Give Him the first part of your harvest.

47
01:00:15.794 --> 01:00:17.794
And then the next says.

48
01:00:18.794 --> 01:00:25.794
Then your barns will always be filled with grain and your wine presses will overflow with wine.

49
01:00:27.794 --> 01:00:33.794
Today, I would translate that as your pantry and your refrigerators will always be full.

50
01:00:34.794 --> 01:00:35.794
There is always provision.

51
01:00:36.794 --> 01:00:39.794
And whether that comes from the left or the right, it doesn't matter.

52
01:00:40.794 --> 01:00:41.794
God is a God of wonders.

53
01:00:42.194 --> 01:00:46.194
And that is why I want to challenge you to truly trust God.

54
01:00:47.194 --> 01:00:50.194
Have you given everything, your first part of your salary?

55
01:00:51.194 --> 01:00:52.194
That's exciting.

56
01:00:53.194 --> 01:00:57.194
Super exciting to do that for the first time and to think, Lord, will this work?

57
01:00:58.194 --> 01:01:04.194
God says, trust me, whether it comes from the left or the right, but I will prepare your way.

58
01:01:05.194 --> 01:01:06.194
I will outline your life.

59
01:01:07.194 --> 01:01:08.194
I take care of your life.

60
01:01:09.194 --> 01:01:11.194
That is what I want to challenge you with.

61
01:01:12.194 --> 01:01:13.194
So give boldly.

62
01:01:14.194 --> 01:01:18.194
And do that together with God, so that you will see, God blesses you.

63
01:01:19.194 --> 01:01:20.194
God is with you. Amen.

64
01:01:42.194 --> 01:01:44.194
This is especially for the ladies.

65
01:01:45.194 --> 01:01:49.194
Next Wednesday is the second time in 2024 that we will gather together.

66
01:01:52.194 --> 01:01:55.194
Most of us already know, but this is the reminder.

67
01:01:57.194 --> 01:01:58.194
Who is coming?

68
01:01:58.594 --> 01:02:01.594
Come on, come on, the whole room, that's good.

69
01:02:02.594 --> 01:02:05.594
Amen, okay, 7:30 PM, come, fellowship.

70
01:02:06.594 --> 01:02:09.594
The idea is, years ago I did it four times a year.

71
01:02:19.594 --> 01:02:22.594
It was to have more time together per year.

72
01:02:25.594 --> 01:02:27.594
Not too much, but enough.

73
01:02:28.594 --> 01:02:30.594
A lot is happening in the church.

74
01:02:35.594 --> 01:02:37.594
But we meet four times a year.

75
01:02:50.594 --> 01:02:54.594
And it is strategic, we share the Word, we worship together, we pray together.

76
01:02:54.994 --> 01:02:57.994
We pray together, we pray together, and see that as a strategic moment.

77
01:03:03.994 --> 01:03:06.994
So come with expectation to hear from the Lord.

78
01:03:13.994 --> 01:03:16.994
For we live in these days, we need to hear from the Lord.

79
01:03:17.394 --> 01:03:21.394
And I speak to us as the collective of women in the house.

80
01:03:27.394 --> 01:03:30.394
I speak to us as the collective of women in the house.

81
01:03:40.394 --> 01:03:45.394
It is about our shared calling, our common purpose here on earth.

82
01:03:47.394 --> 01:03:50.394
How we make cupcakes, I don't do those kinds of stories.

83
01:03:51.394 --> 01:03:53.394
We are going online with what the Lord is doing.

84
01:03:54.394 --> 01:03:58.394
So if you're not sure, you know, we're not talking about cakes and baking.

85
01:03:59.394 --> 01:04:05.394
We are going for the purpose and intercession and reaching our common height. Amen.

86
01:04:06.394 --> 01:04:08.394
Amen, that's what I am going to say.

87
01:04:08.794 --> 01:04:10.794
Do you know what is so nice?

88
01:04:11.794 --> 01:04:17.794
We not only have women's evenings, but we have something for everyone in the church.

89
01:04:18.794 --> 01:04:28.794
Because starting today, the registration forms for the summer camps are online on the website.

90
01:04:29.794 --> 01:04:34.794
And it is for the children's camp, the youth camp, and the men's camp.

91
01:04:35.194 --> 01:04:37.194
There is at least one person who will go along.

92
01:04:40.194 --> 01:04:43.194
So I would say, go to the website.

93
01:04:44.194 --> 01:04:47.194
We will post about it this afternoon in the church app.

94
01:04:48.194 --> 01:04:55.194
But you can already plan your vacation, register your children, register your young people, or register your husband.

95
01:04:56.194 --> 01:04:57.194
Also important.

96
01:04:57.594 --> 01:05:01.594
On June 16, we have a baby blessing service.

97
01:05:02.594 --> 01:05:08.594
And it is very important that you give your children God's Word in their lives.

98
01:05:09.594 --> 01:05:10.594
And God's blessing.

99
01:05:11.594 --> 01:05:12.594
And protection.

100
01:05:13.594 --> 01:05:15.594
And pray for them.

101
01:05:16.594 --> 01:05:18.594
That they give up the summer camps.

102
01:05:19.594 --> 01:05:21.594
That they give up the summer camps.

103
01:05:22.594 --> 01:05:24.594
That they give up the summer camps.

104
01:05:24.994 --> 01:05:25.994
And pray for them.

105
01:05:26.994 --> 01:05:30.994
That also the talents they receive at birth,

106
01:05:31.994 --> 01:05:36.994
that they will develop so that they can be used in God's plan.

107
01:05:37.994 --> 01:05:38.994
Super important.

108
01:05:39.994 --> 01:05:43.994
If you want your child to be secured, come to me after the service.

109
01:05:44.994 --> 01:05:45.994
And finally.

110
01:05:46.994 --> 01:05:51.994
Next week we will hold collections for Tikkun Global.

111
01:05:52.394 --> 01:05:56.394
Tikkun Global is a Christian church in Jerusalem.

112
01:05:57.394 --> 01:05:59.394
And we really want to support them as a church.

113
01:06:00.394 --> 01:06:02.394
Not only with prayer, but also financially.

114
01:06:03.394 --> 01:06:04.394
They are having a very hard time.

115
01:06:05.394 --> 01:06:10.394
And they speak the Word of God in a very difficult situation.

116
01:06:11.394 --> 01:06:15.394
And we pray that people there will see supernatural wonders.

117
01:06:15.794 --> 01:06:21.794
And that our Jewish brothers and sisters will also see who the Messiah is.

118
01:06:22.794 --> 01:06:25.794
That they will recognize that Jesus is the Messiah.

119
01:06:26.794 --> 01:06:27.794
It is not too late for them.

120
01:06:28.794 --> 01:06:29.794
And we pray for that.

121
01:06:30.794 --> 01:06:31.794
And there we support them for that.

122
01:06:32.794 --> 01:06:35.794
And so next week we have the collections for that.

123
01:06:36.794 --> 01:06:37.794
Think about it.

124
01:06:38.194 --> 01:06:41.194
Have a chat about it together this week.

125
01:06:42.194 --> 01:06:48.194
What do you want to give for our brothers and sisters in that difficult situation?

126
01:06:50.194 --> 01:06:51.194
That was it for me.

127
01:06:54.194 --> 01:06:56.194
May I invite Ruben?

128
01:06:57.194 --> 01:07:00.194
Ruben is going to bless us with the Word today.

129
01:07:01.194 --> 01:07:02.194
Amen.

130
01:07:08.194 --> 01:07:09.194
Good morning.

131
01:07:11.194 --> 01:07:13.194
It is nice to be in the house of God.

132
01:07:14.194 --> 01:07:17.194
And thank you, band, for leading us.

133
01:07:19.194 --> 01:07:21.194
For me, it was a new song anyway.

134
01:07:22.194 --> 01:07:25.194
Not about get ready, but in any case, get ready.

135
01:07:26.194 --> 01:07:27.194
Jesus is coming.

136
01:07:29.194 --> 01:07:30.194
How true is that?

137
01:07:31.194 --> 01:07:32.194
Jesus is coming.

138
01:07:33.194 --> 01:07:34.194
Jesus is coming.

139
01:07:34.594 --> 01:07:35.594
Jesus is coming.

140
01:07:36.594 --> 01:07:37.594
How true is that?

141
01:07:39.594 --> 01:07:42.594
How wonderful is that if you believe it?

142
01:07:44.594 --> 01:07:53.594
And before I begin with the Word, I want to pray for this Word that it will truly find entrance into your hearts.

143
01:07:54.594 --> 01:07:56.594
For it is time that we make a choice.

144
01:07:57.594 --> 01:08:01.594
Heavenly Father, I want to thank you for who you are.

145
01:08:01.994 --> 01:08:04.994
Lord God, I want to thank you that you reveal yourself through your Word.

146
01:08:05.994 --> 01:08:06.994
Through your Spirit.

147
01:08:08.994 --> 01:08:13.994
I want to thank you, Lord God, that your love for us is so infinite.

148
01:08:14.994 --> 01:08:15.994
So all-encompassing.

149
01:08:16.994 --> 01:08:19.994
Lord God, that you have a plan for each of us.

150
01:08:20.994 --> 01:08:24.994
Lord God, I want to thank you that you are with us, Lord God, until the end.

151
01:08:25.994 --> 01:08:28.994
And that you never, ever give up on us.

152
01:08:29.394 --> 01:08:30.394
You are with us.

153
01:08:31.394 --> 01:08:32.394
Always.

154
01:08:33.394 --> 01:08:37.394
Lord God, I thank you for this Word, Lord God, and I also thank you that I may read in your Word.

155
01:08:38.394 --> 01:08:43.394
That every word that goes out and that is from you, Lord God, will not return empty.

156
01:08:44.394 --> 01:08:48.394
And I want to pray that it will find entrance in the hearts of everyone who is here.

157
01:08:49.394 --> 01:08:53.394
It will take root and bear fruit in the name of Jesus.

158
01:08:54.394 --> 01:08:55.394
Amen.

159
01:08:55.794 --> 01:08:56.794
Amen.

160
01:08:58.794 --> 01:09:00.794
We must make a choice.

161
01:09:01.794 --> 01:09:03.794
And that is actually what it is about today.

162
01:09:04.794 --> 01:09:08.794
And you might think about that choice, we all know that well.

163
01:09:09.794 --> 01:09:11.794
That we have to make a choice.

164
01:09:12.794 --> 01:09:14.794
But I want to be very clear about that.

165
01:09:15.794 --> 01:09:18.794
Why do I want to be clear about that? Because the Bible is clear about it.

166
01:09:19.194 --> 01:09:28.194
And the Bible also strongly shows that depending on that choice, the rest of our life is determined.

167
01:09:31.194 --> 01:09:34.194
It determines how you will continue to build your life.

168
01:09:35.194 --> 01:09:37.194
It determines how you will organize your life.

169
01:09:39.194 --> 01:09:44.194
And I can actually reassure you at the same time.

170
01:09:44.594 --> 01:09:45.594
Reassure.

171
01:09:47.594 --> 01:09:51.594
Because the Bible is also very clear about how many choices there are.

172
01:09:52.594 --> 01:09:53.594
Namely two.

173
01:09:56.594 --> 01:10:01.594
And I know that we humans are very inclined to make everything complicated.

174
01:10:02.594 --> 01:10:04.594
And that we often like to have options.

175
01:10:05.594 --> 01:10:07.594
That we like to think about such things.

176
01:10:08.594 --> 01:10:11.594
How does that fit? How can that be? How does that fit into my life?

177
01:10:11.994 --> 01:10:12.994
How do we weigh everything?

178
01:10:13.994 --> 01:10:16.994
And I think that in the Western world, that is even stronger than elsewhere.

179
01:10:17.994 --> 01:10:18.994
We like options.

180
01:10:19.994 --> 01:10:20.994
We like choices.

181
01:10:22.994 --> 01:10:25.994
And at the same time we often think, I made that choice quite well.

182
01:10:26.994 --> 01:10:28.994
While we actually know nothing.

183
01:10:29.994 --> 01:10:30.994
For tomorrow it could be something different.

184
01:10:31.994 --> 01:10:33.994
Tomorrow the world could suddenly look very different.

185
01:10:35.994 --> 01:10:39.994
Ultimately, the choice you are going to make determines where you will end up.

186
01:10:40.394 --> 01:10:41.394
And I want that...

187
01:10:42.394 --> 01:10:44.394
I just said it, the Bible is very clear about that.

188
01:10:45.394 --> 01:10:49.394
Let's read, Matthew 7, verses 13 to 14.

189
01:10:50.394 --> 01:10:52.394
I have a Bible here with me to kind of...

190
01:10:53.394 --> 01:10:56.394
It doesn't have to be a competition, but then I know approximately when I can start reading.

191
01:10:57.394 --> 01:11:01.394
Matthew, the first book of the New Testament.

192
01:11:02.394 --> 01:11:06.394
Chapter 7, verses 13 and 14.

193
01:11:10.394 --> 01:11:13.394
It's simply about the broad and the narrow way.

194
01:11:18.394 --> 01:11:20.394
Jesus said... Are we there?

195
01:11:21.394 --> 01:11:22.394
Yes, okay.

196
01:11:23.394 --> 01:11:25.394
Jesus said to his disciples...

197
01:11:26.394 --> 01:11:27.394
Enter through the narrow gate.

198
01:11:28.394 --> 01:11:30.394
And I will read it now a little bit like...

199
01:11:31.394 --> 01:11:32.394
I don't know if you heard it.

200
01:11:33.394 --> 01:11:34.394
Enter through the narrow gate.

201
01:11:35.394 --> 01:11:36.394
Does that mean anything?

202
01:11:37.394 --> 01:11:38.394
No, because it is not so.

203
01:11:38.794 --> 01:11:40.794
Enter through the narrow gate.

204
01:11:41.794 --> 01:11:42.794
Imperative mood.

205
01:11:43.794 --> 01:11:45.794
I think we are so used to reading this part...

206
01:11:46.794 --> 01:11:48.794
Jesus said to his disciples...

207
01:11:49.794 --> 01:11:50.794
Enter through the narrow gate.

208
01:11:51.794 --> 01:11:52.794
For the gate to destruction is wide.

209
01:11:53.794 --> 01:11:54.794
That is not stated here.

210
01:11:55.794 --> 01:11:58.794
Jesus knows what that choice entails.

211
01:11:59.794 --> 01:12:00.794
He says...

212
01:12:01.794 --> 01:12:03.794
Enter through that narrow gate.

213
01:12:04.794 --> 01:12:05.794
That is quite something...

214
01:12:06.194 --> 01:12:07.194
Enter through that narrow gate.

215
01:12:08.194 --> 01:12:09.194
That is quite something different.

216
01:12:10.194 --> 01:12:12.194
For the gate to destruction is wide.

217
01:12:13.194 --> 01:12:15.194
And the way to it is broad.

218
01:12:16.194 --> 01:12:19.194
And there are many people who take that way...

219
01:12:20.194 --> 01:12:21.194
And enter through that gate.

220
01:12:22.194 --> 01:12:25.194
But the gate to life is narrow.

221
01:12:26.194 --> 01:12:28.194
And the way to it is narrow.

222
01:12:29.194 --> 01:12:35.194
There are but few people who find that way and that gate.

223
01:12:36.194 --> 01:12:38.194
Enter through that narrow gate.

224
01:12:39.194 --> 01:12:40.194
And ultimately...

225
01:12:41.194 --> 01:12:42.194
I stand here in the church.

226
01:12:43.194 --> 01:12:46.194
And I would wish nothing more than for everyone to enter through that narrow gate.

227
01:12:47.194 --> 01:12:49.194
For it is the gate that leads to life.

228
01:12:50.194 --> 01:12:51.194
And you could say...

229
01:12:52.194 --> 01:12:53.194
Why narrow?

230
01:12:54.194 --> 01:12:55.194
And why broad?

231
01:12:56.194 --> 01:12:57.194
I think that has to do with this.

232
01:12:58.194 --> 01:12:59.194
For very often we think...

233
01:13:00.194 --> 01:13:01.194
Or people look at us as Christians...

234
01:13:02.194 --> 01:13:04.194
They must give up so much?

235
01:13:04.594 --> 01:13:06.594
They must leave so much behind?

236
01:13:07.594 --> 01:13:09.594
They are not allowed much, right?

237
01:13:10.594 --> 01:13:14.594
While this indicates to me that narrow means...

238
01:13:15.594 --> 01:13:16.594
There is one way.

239
01:13:17.594 --> 01:13:18.594
Jesus Christ.

240
01:13:19.594 --> 01:13:21.594
The way, the truth, and the life.

241
01:13:22.594 --> 01:13:25.594
And that is also the only way to truly have life.

242
01:13:26.594 --> 01:13:27.594
Do you know that?

243
01:13:28.594 --> 01:13:30.594
And all those other possibilities...

244
01:13:31.594 --> 01:13:32.594
That's why it is called broad.

245
01:13:32.994 --> 01:13:34.994
That broad gate or that broad way.

246
01:13:35.994 --> 01:13:36.994
There are so many options.

247
01:13:37.994 --> 01:13:38.994
If you look today...

248
01:13:39.994 --> 01:13:41.994
When I speak with my colleagues or with people who are not believers...

